    "id": "w-u49-04",
    "unit": "u49",
    "prompt": "You are Tomás. Write to the families who run the other shops on your block (the bakery, the shoe repair shop and the bookshop) to propose a neighbours' group that defends the block against Altamira. Use solicitamos su colaboración para… once, and write on behalf of the café team (we), with ustedes.",
